<title>INDONESIA: Bhuwanatala rights issue approved.</title>
<headline>Bhuwanatala rights issue approved.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian property company PT Bhuwanatala Indah Permai said on Tuesday its rights-cum-warrant issue has been approved by shareholders.</p>
<p>Bhuwanatala is offering 10 new shares, with one warrant attached, at 5,000 rupiah for every four shares held.</p>
<p>Each warrant has one underlying share of par value of 500 rupiah, exerciseable at 500 rupiah from November 29, 1996 to November 28, 2001.</p>
<p>It said the proceeds would be used to acquire a stake in property company PT Duta Wisata Loka and to reduce debts.</p>
<p>It will issue 360 million shares and 36 million warrants.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
